=2 Walkthrough
__You must zone after completing {q:Imperial Espionage|Imperial Espionage|Imperial Espionage} before you can start this quest.__
* Talk to {p:Tyamah (A)} at (F-7) Conflux #7 to begin this quest.
* He asks you to take pictures of "abnormal, unnatural Abyssean fiends".
* Retrieve the {p:Soulgauger SGR-1} and purchase 12x {p:Blank Gauger Plates|Blank Gauger Plate} from the chests next to him.
* Your objective is to obtain a good quality {i:Gauger Plate|Gauger Plate|2480} for each of the following monsters. It is a good idea to take three pictures of each after you lower their health to around 20%, and stand in front of them.)
** {m:Iceberg Murex}
*** Found at the base of the mountain if you walk from the base camp/Conflux #1 towards Conflux #2.
** {m:Floe Amoeban}
*** Same as above.
** {m:Crag Limule}
*** Found on the mountain after landing in the same hole as the quest {q:Slip Slidin' Away|Slip Slidin' Away|Slip Slidin' Away}.
** {m:Range Clionid}
*** Can be found in the tunnels near Conflux #3
**** Conflux #3 can be found by falling 1/3'd the way from the southern side of the western slope.
* Trade all four plates to {p:Tyamah (A)} to complete the quest.

